这是一个可直接在浏览器中离线使用的HTML工具，用于删除多行文本中的空行，同时保留非空行的首尾空格和原有顺序。
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>空行清理 · 离线小工具</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fb;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .app-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 2rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: #0b1b32;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .subhead {
            color: #4a5b6e;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            padding-left: 1rem;
            background: #f0f4fe;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            line-height: 1.4;
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
        }

        .subhead code {
            background: #e2e8f0;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .editor-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .editor-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1rem;
            }
            .app-container {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
        }

        .panel {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: #f9fafc;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
        }

        .panel:focus-within {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .panel-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #1e2b3c;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .panel-header span {
